  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Prepare eGovernment Strategy and Government Enterprise Architecture for Ethiopia (2023-2027/28)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The general objective of this contract is to develop a five-year e-government strategy and e-government architecture/model that enables the Government of Ethiopia to be result oriented, efficient, provide citizen-centric, secured, and integrated e-government services.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
